    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>The Internet is on Trial, and You're the Judge.</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Investigate Petty Drama With Unique Tools at your Disposal.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634760/extras/1c9c46cf343b81612955b601ed3f05a2.poster.avif?t=1752581376\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634760/extras/1c9c46cf343b81612955b601ed3f05a2.webm?t=1752581376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634760/extras/1c9c46cf343b81612955b601ed3f05a2.mp4?t=1752581376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short game (about an hour and a half) focused on moral judgements and social media.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Review &quot;Am I The Asshole&quot; Posts, Snoop through phones &amp; text messages, Interrogate suspects and witnesses, Judge YTA (You're The Asshole) or NTA (Not The Asshole).</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>A Fully Functioning Crypto Market Simulator.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634760/extras/817932a9cdcc9fd854a456c9e484714f.poster.avif?t=1752581376\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634760/extras/817932a9cdcc9fd854a456c9e484714f.webm?t=1752581376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634760/extras/817932a9cdcc9fd854a456c9e484714f.mp4?t=1752581376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy and sell different stocks/crypto. Try to time the market to make a profit or else be the loser left holding the bag.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Jury Twitch Chat Integration.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634760/extras/866aa8a241ab6099542288d323a875f3.poster.avif?t=1752581376\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634760/extras/866aa8a241ab6099542288d323a875f3.webm?t=1752581376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634760/extras/866aa8a241ab6099542288d323a875f3.mp4?t=1752581376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grill twitch chat like a courtroom jury. Poll them on YTA or NTA and let democracy do its worst.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Decorate Your Room.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634760/extras/aa309a6dd9d44b148f3080d6ec1755f0.poster.avif?t=1752581376\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634760/extras/aa309a6dd9d44b148f3080d6ec1755f0.webm?t=1752581376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634760/extras/aa309a6dd9d44b148f3080d6ec1755f0.mp4?t=1752581376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your space with posters, desks, figurines, chairs, and more. Build your aesthetic: Cluttercore, Minimalism, Gooner Cave\u2014whatever lets you cope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
